{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 106,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Praise ye Jehovah.\nOh give thanks unto Jehovah; for he is good;\nFor his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who can utter the mighty acts of Jehovah,\nOr show forth all his praise?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed are they that keep justice,\nAnd he that doeth righteousness at all times.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember me, O Jehovah, with the favor that thou bearest unto thy people;\nOh visit me with thy salvation,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That I may see the prosperity of thy chosen,\nThat I may rejoice in the gladness of thy nation,\nThat I may glory with thine inheritance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We have sinned with our fathers,\nWe have committed iniquity, we have done wickedly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our fathers understood not thy wonders in Egypt;\nThey remembered not the multitude of thy lovingkindnesses,\nBut were rebellious at the sea, even at the Red Sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless he saved them for his name’s sake,\nThat he might make his mighty power to be known.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He rebuked the Red Sea also, and it was dried up:\nSo he led them through the depths, as through a wilderness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he saved them from the hand of him that hated them,\nAnd redeemed them from the hand of the enemy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the waters covered their adversaries;\nThere was not one of them left.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then believed they his words;\nThey sang his praise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They soon forgat his works;\nThey waited not for his counsel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But lusted exceedingly in the wilderness,\nAnd tempted God in the desert.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he gave them their request,\nBut sent leanness into their soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They envied Moses also in the camp,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Aaron the saint of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The earth opened and swallowed up Dathan,\nAnd covered the company of Abiram.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And a fire was kindled in their company;\nThe flame burned up the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They made a calf in Horeb,\nAnd worshipped a molten image.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus they changed their glory\nFor the likeness of an ox that eateth grass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They forgat God their Saviour,\nWho had done great things in Egypt,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wondrous works in the land of Ham,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " terrible things by the Red Sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore he said that he would destroy them,\nHad not Moses his chosen stood before him in the breach,\nTo turn away his wrath, lest he should destroy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, they despised the pleasant land,\nThey believed not his word,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But murmured in their tents,\nAnd hearkened not unto the voice of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore he sware unto them,\nThat he would overthrow them in the wilderness,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And that he would overthrow their seed among the nations,\nAnd scatter them in the lands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They joined themselves also unto Baal-peor,\nAnd ate the sacrifices of the dead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus they provoked him to anger with their doings;\nAnd the plague brake in upon them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then stood up Phinehas, and executed judgment;\nAnd so the plague was stayed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And that was reckoned unto him for righteousness,\nUnto all generations for evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They angered him also at the waters of Meribah,\nSo that it went ill with Moses for their sakes;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because they were rebellious against his spirit,\nAnd he spake unadvisedly with his lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They did not destroy the peoples,\nAs Jehovah commanded them,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But mingled themselves with the nations,\nAnd learned their works,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And served their idols,\nWhich became a snare unto them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, they sacrificed their sons and their daughters unto demons,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And shed innocent blood,\nEven the blood of their sons and of their daughters,\nWhom they sacrificed unto the idols of Canaan;\nAnd the land was polluted with blood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus were they defiled with their works,\nAnd played the harlot in their doings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore was the wrath of Jehovah kindled against his people,\nAnd he abhorred his inheritance.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he gave them into the hand of the nations;\nAnd they that hated them ruled over them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their enemies also oppressed them,\nAnd they were brought into subjection under their hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many times did he deliver them;\nBut they were rebellious in their counsel,\nAnd were brought low in their iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless he regarded their distress,\nWhen he heard their cry:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he remembered for them his covenant,\nAnd repented according to the multitude of his lovingkindnesses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.46",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.46",
      "verse": 46,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He made them also to be pitied\nOf all those that carried them captive.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.47",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.47",
      "verse": 47,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save us, O Jehovah our God,\nAnd gather us from among the nations,\nTo give thanks unto thy holy name,\nAnd to triumph in thy praise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.106.48",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.106.48",
      "verse": 48,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed be Jehovah, the God of Israel,\nFrom everlasting even to everlasting.\nAnd let all the people say, Amen.Praise ye Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Israel’s rebelliousness and Jehovah’s deliverances.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
